DATE an ordinary one 03/15/2024
DATE the earliest year the range allows 01/01/0100
DATE February 30th is the empty date   /  /
DATE February 29th in a leap year 02/29/2024

DATE month 13 is out of the structural range         11

DATE year 99 is below the range         11
DATE with only a year is too few arguments, not error 11       1229
DATE with a year and a month is still too few       1229
DATETIME with hours, minutes and seconds 03/15/2024 01:45:30 PM
DATETIME with only an hour 03/15/2024 05:00:00 AM
DATETIME with an hour and a minute 03/15/2024 05:30:00 AM
DATETIME with none of hms is midnight 03/15/2024 12:00:00 AM

DATETIME hour 24 is out of range         11
DATETIME with only a year is too few arguments       1229
DATETIME with a year and a month is still too few       1229
DTOC formatted, no second argument 03/15/2024
DTOC with a 1 20240315
DTOC with a 0 is the same unformatted form 20240315
QUARTER with no argument at all       1229
CDOW of that January 1st Saturday
WEEK rule 1 is the week holding January 1st  1
WEEK rule 2 needs four days in the new year 52
